0 17 517 [
[(The creation arguments specify the template of a new scalar to append and its)]
[(field name\050s\051 you wish to initialize. There should be at least one field name and)]
[(each field name creates a corresponding inlet. The inlets can only take floats, so)]
[(you have to specify field variables that can only take numeric values. If you need)]
[(to set other values \050such as symbols\051 you need other objects to set these fields.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 17 432 [
[(To append objects, send numbers to set the field values. The leftmost inlet is the)]
[("hot" that adds the item. The [append]'s pointer is updated to point to the newly)]
[(added scalar and the new pointer is output via the outlet. To insert to the)]
[(beginning of a list, you can point to the "head" of the list with [pointer] as)]
[(below.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
